# The pointer and every control it answers

This specification file has not been written yet.

**Scope.** That a click is a tap and a drag is a touch drag, on the same footing; that every pointer sample a frame delivers is answered in the order it arrived; the grab rule; the drag threshold and what it decides; that a held run follows the pointer and a legal target under it is highlighted; the drop rule, resolved against the drop rectangles specs/table.md fixes; the double-click rule with its window and its slop, and the auto-move it performs; sole ownership of the hit rectangles for the two title items, the how-to BACK item and the three HUD controls; the overlay toggle key. Branches on engine.slug.
